#. module: atmta_procurement_control
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_control/models/approval_rule.py:0
msgid ""
"An approval decision cannot be deleted. Cancel the requisition, or revise it"
" — both keep the history."
msgstr ""
"لا يمكن حذف قرار الاعتماد. قم بإلغاء طلب الشراء أو مراجعته — فكلاهما يحتفظ "
"بالسجل."

#. module: atmta_procurement_control
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/atmta_procurement_control/models/approval_rule.py:0
msgid ""
"An earlier approval step is still pending. Approving out of order would mean"
" the sequence was decoration."
msgstr ""
"لا تزال خطوة اعتماد سابقة معلقة. الاعتماد خارج الترتيب يعني أن التسلسل مجرد "
"شكل."

#. module: atmta_procurement_control
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:atmta_procurement_control.field_realestate_procurement_reservation__anomaly_note
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:atmta_procurement_control.view_procurement_reservation_search
