msgid ""
"M3Q — the worklist entry for this step, when the step names a person to "
"assign it to. One activity, created once and closed on decision: an activity"
" generated from a compute or a cron produces a new one every recomputation, "
"and people stop reading a list that lies about how much work is in it."
